  "title": "Creditor-rights analysis",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Creditor-rights analysis</h2><p>Evaluate a secured-credit file and a subsequent bankruptcy event.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f1\">Concept supported by value, debtor rights, and valid agreement</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"Attachment\">Attachment</option><option value=\"Automatic discharge\">Automatic discharge</option><option value=\"Tax exemption\">Tax exemption</option><option value=\"Audit assurance\">Audit assurance</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f2\">Ordinary priority under the given facts</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Lender A\">Lender A</option><option value=\"Lender B\">Lender B</option><option value=\"Neither interest can attach\">Neither interest can attach</option><option value=\"Priority is decided only by loan size\">Priority is decided only by loan size</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f3\">Response to B’s proposed seizure</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Evaluate the stay and obtain any necessary relief\">Evaluate the stay and obtain any necessary relief</option><option value=\"Seize automatically\">Seize automatically</option><option value=\"Ignore bankruptcy filings\">Ignore bankruptcy filings</option><option value=\"Destroy the financing statement\">Destroy the financing statement</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f4\">Correct the analyst’s statement</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Discharge and lien treatment require separate statutory analysis\">Discharge and lien treatment require separate statutory analysis</option><option value=\"Every lien always disappears\">Every lien always disappears</option><option value=\"No debt can ever be discharged\">No debt can ever be discharged</option><option value=\"Only interest rates matter\">Only interest rates matter</option></select></div></section>",
